  "statement": "Find the sum\n\n\\[\\frac{2^{1}}{4^{1}-1}+\\frac{2^{2}}{4^{2}-1}+\\frac{2^{4}}{4^{4}-1}+\\frac{2^{8}}{4^{8}-1}+\\cdots .\\]",
  "answerChoices": [],
